<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Auth0 Symfony SDK - Management API</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; max-width: 900px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; color: #333; }
        h1 { color: #635dff; }
        a { color: #635dff; text-decoration: none; }
        a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        .navbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 12px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .navbar .brand { font-weight: 600; color: #635dff; font-size: 1.1em; }
        .tabs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .tab { display: inline-block; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #635dff; color: #635dff; font-size: 0.9em; }
        .tab:hover { background: #f0eeff; text-decoration: none; }
        .tab.active { background: #635dff; color: #fff; }
        pre { background: #1e1e1e; color: #d4d4d4; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: auto; font-size: 0.85em; line-height: 1.5; }
        .error { background: #fdecea; border: 1px solid #f5c6cb; color: #842029; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; white-space: pre-wrap; }
        .meta { color: #666; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 8px 0; }
        code { background: #f4f4f4; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9em; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="navbar">
        <span class="brand">Auth0 Symfony SDK - Management API</span>
        <a href="/" class="tab">Home</a>
    </nav>

    <h1>Management API Explorer</h1>
    <p>Each tab calls <code>$auth0-&gt;getManagement()-&gt;{resource}-&gt;list()</code>, which fetches a management token via client credentials and auto-paginates the response. Results are capped at 25 items.</p>

    <div class="tabs">
        {% for key, meta in resources %}
            <a href="/management?resource={{ key }}" class="tab {{ key == selected ? 'active' : '' }}">{{ meta.label }}</a>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% if error %}
        <div class="error">{{ error }}</div>
    {% else %}
        <p class="meta">Showing {{ count }} item(s) from <code>{{ selected }}</code>.</p>
        <pre>{{ result }}</pre>
    {% endif %}
</body>
</html>
